      labs: ["Use the blood-gas PaCO2 and HCO3 from the same specimen when possible, and reconcile major disagreement with chemistry total CO2.", "Calculate anion gap and delta relationships after recognizing metabolic acidosis because compensation formulas do not detect a second metabolic process.", "Check oxygenation, lactate, ketones, electrolytes, albumin, creatinine, and medication or toxin exposure to find the cause."],
